# UI copy dashes

All user-visible text in the UI (labels, descriptions, preview copy, notes, tooltips, empty states) must use `-` only.

Never use `—` or `–` in UI strings.

```ts
// BAD
"HELD — this loop is on"
"It does not care how long you held — only that N is up."

// GOOD
"HELD - this loop is on"
"It does not care how long you held - only that N is up."
```

This applies to React copy, helper strings, and any new UI text. It does not apply to chrome icons (for example the minimize mark) or third-party files.
